---
const bullets = [
  'Recommended setup uses Docker Compose',
  'Data stays on your own hardware',
  'No hosted accounts or cloud dependency',
  'Set SELFHOST_ADMIN_TOKEN before public exposure',
];
---
<section id="self-host" class="bg-white px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-honey-200 bg-honey-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-honey-600">
        Get started
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-warm-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Run it in two commands
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-warm-700">
        Docker Compose is the recommended path. No accounts to create, no cloud configuration to figure out.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 p-8 lg:p-12">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-700">
            {bullets.map((bullet) => (
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-honey-500">✓</span>
                <span>{bullet}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/nacho-labs-llc/fridgeshare/blob/master/docs/SELF_HOSTING.md"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border-2 border-warm-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-warm-800 transition hover:border-warm-400 hover:bg-warm-100"
            >
              Read the self-hosting guide →
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/nacho-labs-llc/fridgeshare"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border-2 border-warm-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-warm-800 transition hover:border-warm-400 hover:bg-warm-100"
            >
              View GitHub →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl bg-warm-900 px-6 py-5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-green-400">
          <p class="text-warm-500"># Download the Compose file and start</p>
          curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nacho-labs-llc/fridgeshare/main/docker-compose.yml \<br />
          &nbsp;&nbsp;-o docker-compose.yml<br />
          docker compose up -d<br />
          <br />
          <p class="text-warm-500"># Open the board directory</p>
          open http://localhost:4173
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
